{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainChartTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainChartTitle", "text": "STRAIN THROUGH THE DAY", "sha256": "2364b2280954afc577fe82a713fb1daf5d01653778f90f78761337a6498b9238", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainChartFootnote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainChartFootnote", "text": "Effort banked above your usual waking pace — it can ease later in the day if intensity drops back toward that pace, even though the STEEP parts already happened. Built from {drawn} recorded waking minutes.", "sha256": "68e4afcb6dafd8324e23552b956b1f07ab8342a1c5f05f92950ccffa4c5ebd8a", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainPeakHr", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainPeakHr", "text": "Peak HR", "sha256": "714d88ee80cc4a2a7a95b909d5c5cfcf98007343250d60a1a7b0392d25f18fcb", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainWorn", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainWorn", "text": "Worn", "sha256": "31a0a549d3df608d95c0baec819a49537e76fcfe8fb1d680c5d4f8a00d809b1c", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainLowCoverageTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainLowCoverageTitle", "text": "The band saw {pct}% of this day", "sha256": "fc250aef610ad3f34f5ffd48257902ee3aa531bed4b8fd7e0470d5eb95830efc", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainLowCoverageBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainLowCoverageBody", "text": "Strain is a total over the minutes that were recorded, so a partly-worn day reads lower than a full one and the two are not comparable.", "sha256": "11c5bfc34428168e25a9cf058c9d5cc3fd1f40bf5c2702bedcc737d3c9c2bc11", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainTimeInZonesSection", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainTimeInZonesSection", "text": "Time in zones", "sha256": "e74d486fb209fdae177498064df91fb9b3d3022ae2d2defc3960e447896a0c21", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainZonesChartTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainZonesChartTitle", "text": "TIME IN ZONES", "sha256": "3f95848250e73059c8b8764b56422938a36f41c0869159c041b87386f4e01c95", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainZoneFootnoteKarvonen", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainZoneFootnoteKarvonen", "text": "Zone edges span the gap between your measured resting heart rate and the highest we have seen ({maxHr} bpm). Both measured on you.", "sha256": "f47c9ab06c267aebde5d9168f2957f17052059d74b564e686a290b9133500932", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainZoneFootnoteObserved", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainZoneFootnoteObserved", "text": "Zone edges are percentages of the highest heart rate we have seen ({maxHr} bpm) — measured, not estimated.", "sha256": "d91aece109adea28d433d99c496887378061f8b0954d507ecc1ee0d22b4d094a", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainHowSet", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainHowSet", "text": "How these are set", "sha256": "57d37db4f59bc80cdeda24879362f7edec20adfd8b8e3957b57e48428e5c12a2", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainInputsSection", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainInputsSection", "text": "What this is made of", "sha256": "5446e52a207e29c8a70c835a8dd1deb483904af9609e069b977b55ce2ddb026b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainInputsBase", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainInputsBase", "text": "Banister TRIMP over your waking heart rate, scaled to 0–21.", "sha256": "fdf97d9b8a10b22d793a694ad33f928c7aee44185b352ffbf7df12dc95a66bc9", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainInputsMaxHr", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainInputsMaxHr", "text": "It was integrated against an assumed maximum of {maxHr} bpm — estimated from your age and your strap, not measured.", "sha256": "bfa0897dd2a8c536c8f26db171ad14576a64ee7d5d172503706a1114825cc8e8", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainInputsMeasuredCeilingNote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainInputsMeasuredCeilingNote", "text": "The zone bar above uses the measured ceiling instead; strain has not been moved onto it, because that would rewrite every strain score you have ever seen.", "sha256": "cc983176579e115bfbfcb9edc647f29a0a4489e732cfaf0e144829e1507345d6", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStrainInputsRhrAnchor", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStrainInputsRhrAnchor", "text": "The other anchor is your resting heart rate from the night before, so a night the band missed moves the whole day.", "sha256": "88f8d4a1291e396da5176f80022a50c181150fd01babc8247106188561e0a8ff", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesTitle", "text": "Heart-rate zones", "sha256": "e7c78d45cdafa03eb6afc6d758d5fe9ed58346e8801f430b45990aa168518740", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesYourZonesSection", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesYourZonesSection", "text": "Your zones", "sha256": "d58b1ffeeb8c5c3bcf369a3cb7e36d1f6408d1c435e752d0e5b24249abf33a34", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesIntensitySection", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesIntensitySection", "text": "Where your intensity went", "sha256": "5f05481501d8c5be4f517aeb5932b2a8198973c63c4b5310adb047e4dd7ef1e2", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesNoCeilingTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesNoCeilingTitle", "text": "No measured ceiling yet", "sha256": "7cae3701b828cdd0e788f3d2b3516ea50116dbb4909f21caf446555034c536d5", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesNoCeilingTanakaTail", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesNoCeilingTanakaTail", "text": " Until one is measured, the zones below come off your age.", "sha256": "b5e91e3d12e4dc0ea8f08b9f1a84d3588c6ada11db83642b2d6356107770531e", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesNoCeilingDefaultBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesNoCeilingDefaultBody", "text": "We only count a high reading the band held for 15 seconds while you were moving. A one-second spike is not a heart rate.", "sha256": "fbe251481e1dbc94ddc03c945e964d40da85787e36f524db98ec3ab5789adfd1", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesWearBandFix", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesWearBandFix", "text": "Wear the band for your normal hard sessions", "sha256": "7e42d5bdf30fa54e31a036e80b118cc18df7b352b9c125d7e023d2c94be4f77b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesHighestSeenLabel", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesHighestSeenLabel", "text": "HIGHEST WE HAVE SEEN", "sha256": "a5261388bc674ca698624215baf4fb98295968cc0efb1e5fc54f253518f34e38", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesBpmUnit", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesBpmUnit", "text": "bpm", "sha256": "1072d2ef52b36bbfd44dbb70368c08af776326db6b8bda1d66ae3f366fa297d8", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesCeilingOnDate", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesCeilingOnDate", "text": "on {date}", "sha256": "908b9021de877ded8b1159c9b123f0e988076e085151802add98880df09e0d7f", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesCeilingDuringSession", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesCeilingDuringSession", "text": "during {session}", "sha256": "31897d452c6fa7b443e987c9a86891f135c3aa3d5c8ddb20b4908c7adad9cfcb", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesHighestSeenFootnote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesHighestSeenFootnote", "text": "The highest we have measured, not a limit — it creeps up as the band sees harder efforts. Do not go and test it.", "sha256": "af1e8fc9a90d84ef6ba3844d6efde829b617413db04cd14cd137d1910b3a8d43", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesNoZonesTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesNoZonesTitle", "text": "No zones yet", "sha256": "4e4bae0f1fd3d7ad8846c33689a0df2294e4654ce04e56511a9d54160e1b6c7b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesNoAgeBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesNoAgeBody", "text": "Zone edges are percentages of a maximum heart rate, and without your age there is nothing to take a percentage of.", "sha256": "5f75d16f875d2a7d8bfcfdd1d0ce7058a02904a60c661021f723a073c9fe9f7d", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:catalogueZonesWhy", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "catalogueZonesWhy", "text": "Zone edges are percentages of a maximum heart rate estimated from your age — not one measured on you.", "sha256": "b43d05d756268c71dddbae4dfb068326e7be6fdf733a07a2bc701daa87511127", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesNoZonesDefaultBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesNoZonesDefaultBody", "text": "Nothing recorded says why there are no zone edges yet.", "sha256": "b1fabe16fcb7c9a0388d47607b217fa634f422f79f2894cee656e292e59f1b6d", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesAddAgeFix", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesAddAgeFix", "text": "Add your age in Profile", "sha256": "d0f2aedcd22495f5c87739428ae9f624e6b718080fa5e2b238ff2e0734ac23ff", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesAnchorKarvonen", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesAnchorKarvonen", "text": "Built from two numbers the band measured on you: your resting rate ({restingHr}, the middle of your last {restingDays} nights) and the highest we have seen ({maxHr}). A low resting rate makes zone 1 wide. These are the usual bands, not your own measured thresholds.", "sha256": "14845f9c939a52ceef83e608c772f423b668861b21aa1a7ea0985cb67aee8d53", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesAnchorObserved", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesAnchorObserved", "text": "Built from the highest heart rate we have seen ({maxHr}). After {restingMinDays} nights of resting rate (you have {restingDays}) your resting rate joins it, which fits you better. These are the usual bands, not your own measured thresholds.", "sha256": "0d5d1715d1e1239d3981ec554fd4cf86cd5446a8faa31f147e46339c87fa412b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesAnchorTanaka", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesAnchorTanaka", "text": "Built from {maxHr} bpm, estimated from your age rather than measured on you — it can be 20 bpm out either way. The edges move to a measured ceiling once the band sees a hard enough session.", "sha256": "0714927b422a955e966e677b99d6cc3fcb34aafcecbea5c5db573930d2abd24f", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesAnchorDefault", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesAnchorDefault", "text": "Zone edges are percentages of a maximum heart rate.", "sha256": "dc6453f8f28e9578c19cb51afdae3aa11597306a7e6e67774eb8e57716b82888", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesAnchorManual", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesAnchorManual", "text": "Set by you, not computed — these five thresholds override whatever your age or a measured ceiling would have given you.", "sha256": "b3adbd47058b806c04d3a86b90cabb18fa0b14d6409be60f730b560bfbe84350", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesSetYourOwnLink", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesSetYourOwnLink", "text": "Set your own zones", "sha256": "4784099aad3700ab5ad13b833276063ad1f03783f7323cb5afcb8c4506de422b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesEditYourOwnLink", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesEditYourOwnLink", "text": "Edit your own zones", "sha256": "6301a1a4ba5745fd1e1251f8724a13a2090dd547bc033dd5c7e22afb04ae1513", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesEditYourOwnTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesEditYourOwnTitle", "text": "Set your own zones", "sha256": "4784099aad3700ab5ad13b833276063ad1f03783f7323cb5afcb8c4506de422b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesEditYourOwnBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesEditYourOwnBody", "text": "Five bpm thresholds, lowest to highest — where each zone starts. Clear all five to go back to the zones we compute for you.", "sha256": "ce2f7f69b189ae78294156b0a84c532860ff0f4d26c74cff549ee2084c056ef6", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesNeedAllFive", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesNeedAllFive", "text": "All five thresholds are needed, lowest to highest. Nothing was saved.", "sha256": "cf4621442085be0327f7286994a685bf3060c0fbadd4473d3f84cf5915e169a6", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesMustAscend", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesMustAscend", "text": "Each zone must start higher than the last. Nothing was saved.", "sha256": "101838b2ed43dc19e3c578c8a463db84a5b2cef4a264e45eed00b12ae2130c2d", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesNotShownTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesNotShownTitle", "text": "Not shown yet", "sha256": "6876a3dfe7f516d82df1d691b3aca185cd220862d3a62b5941553080fdfc211e", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesNeedsMonthBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesNeedsMonthBody", "text": "Needs about a month of recorded sessions, each with a minute-by-minute heart rate.", "sha256": "6de9601f904930a4884a20b8efd34278295b91ee0c998ecbb54be975f8e49582", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesAgeEstimateBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesAgeEstimateBody", "text": "The bars would be a picture of the age estimate, not of your training. They appear once the zone edges above are measured.", "sha256": "06b4d96018964c197f5b3c05d64e3e7097c09a4e2faf77d890b3a1f74e6a0cf3", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesSessionMinutesChartTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesSessionMinutesChartTitle", "text": "SESSION MINUTES, LAST 28 DAYS", "sha256": "fa8153b1c3ba87022621443087a77dfe4e18744e6e49afd2e034f80514de190c", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesShapePyramidal", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesShapePyramidal", "text": "Most of your minutes are easy, fewer in the middle, fewest hard — a pyramid.", "sha256": "628e740e1de7e51d8b3deea3d273d459e51872cf1d53208ddd1032808fe43ee9", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesShapePolarised", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesShapePolarised", "text": "Most of your minutes are easy and the rest are hard, with little in between.", "sha256": "51fa3a818fafc091e33b35561c19b0d3bbc8ea12598a823262af05c5f27366a7", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesShapeMiddleHeavy", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesShapeMiddleHeavy", "text": "Most of your minutes sit in the middle rather than easy or hard.", "sha256": "4a0fac5404d693b9fd67486375c209dd86ba585271f894fdfd896c720e159d4d", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityZonesShapeSummary", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityZonesShapeSummary", "text": "{easy} min easy, {moderate} moderate, {hard} hard, over {sessions} recorded sessions. A description, not a target.", "sha256": "e7451ab1010ecdc08a85f4a8c81142856897a844638608445a7815ea08ecd9b9", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareTitle", "text": "Share", "sha256": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareOpenFailed", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareOpenFailed", "text": "Could not open the share sheet.", "sha256": "f735218480a6acc4523156997a1058904fbe8b7536a912dd3c3656b5da97bbf5", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activitySharePhotoHeader", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activitySharePhotoHeader", "text": "YOUR PHOTO", "sha256": "7a3f0d929605cce98cfe248dce47f6f9413da8333b54758985809bf2f6e6d9a2", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareAddPhoto", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareAddPhoto", "text": "Add a photo", "sha256": "c3342da7c9f646b6fbdfcd6a14bd207a0241b01bad07f943b7359f6ea951dcc6", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareChangePhoto", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareChangePhoto", "text": "Change photo", "sha256": "c5fbcb8b00ea0d6e1e5bac2c065bb877192271ee9f39e9818dfe43b73d5aec16", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activitySharePhotoHint", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activitySharePhotoHint", "text": "From this phone. Nothing is uploaded", "sha256": "74a36bb3e83b307204e4087da3fe21b6b1afa6a850c7280825e65772bf0c9541", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareRemovePhoto", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareRemovePhoto", "text": "Remove the photo", "sha256": "03e7d534a7af78e7da334fc41ac53d624e0f01d809843cb76fe40988b36c0f91", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareBasemapHeader", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareBasemapHeader", "text": "BASEMAP", "sha256": "8a2c9c49484e90df15550659aed0668846ffd052f33d862fbc60ed09202d1382", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareDrawMap", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareDrawMap", "text": "Draw the real map", "sha256": "5fa4e3c848d00a63fcb080e86669fc8e62a7429f99c3aad3c68a39d4361a5f93", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareMapHint", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareMapHint", "text": "Asks openstreetmap.org for the tiles covering this route. Off, the route draws on its own", "sha256": "b0b695ad9238d4922e24aff862e3029c058166cb561289f932940440dc7cf2e0", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareFetchingMapTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareFetchingMapTitle", "text": "Fetching the map", "sha256": "a9d73085fc37cf93947c44641519c19e05ee13b1a21b7dc316f0e955ef375ff9", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareFetchingMapBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareFetchingMapBody", "text": "The card draws as soon as every tile is here.", "sha256": "bac42b8fb489b118b2e5f85f1e6b29ef65ce08122f12598fc0e126df10ae8a0e", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareNoMapTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareNoMapTitle", "text": "No map for this card", "sha256": "3decc763f3e2b3418a3aac5e926f819588067b556e19663e0c816f2f99327e92", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:activityShareNoMapBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "activityShareNoMapBody", "text": "The map tiles could not be fetched, so the route is drawn on its own. Everything else on the card is unchanged.", "sha256": "4915cc9ccbc4cfb60e94f8c15e0867aac845b404f32c3f4658a8aa7d7ccc0b7a", "kind": "arb"}
